 the globe have been spurred to take measures to limit capital inflows into fast-growing parts of Africa, Latin America and Asia--a trend which has been amplified by super-loose monetary policy in sluggish developed economies.\par \par \uc2 -By Natasha Brereton, Dow Jones Newswires, +65-6415-4044, natasha.brereton@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 January 30, 2011 04:44 ET (09:44 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020110130e71u000w3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
