\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Mexico sold $155 mln last wk in extraordinary sales\b0\par\par\uc2 276 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Februar 2009\par 16:10\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2009 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 (Adds background)\par \par \uc2 MEXICO CITY, Feb 24 (Reuters) - Mexico sold $155 million from its foreign reserves last week in extraordinary sales to boost the sagging peso \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 In a weekly report, the bank said total international reserves fell in the week to Feb. 20 to $80.933 billion, adding that a big part of the fall was due to the extraordinary sales and $400 million sold through scheduled dollar auctions.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Friday, offering dollars directly to dealers after the peso hit a fresh record low against the dollar, \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders said that day.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had not disclosed the amount of dollars it sold during the \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and investors were waiting for the report on reserves for a glimpse of how much may have been spent.\par \par \uc2 The bank also \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market on Monday, but the size of this \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  will not be disclosed until next week.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been holding daily dollar auctions of up to $400 million per day to keep the peso from falling too sharply on any given day. Sales under this auction facility are uncommon as the peso must fall more than 2 percent before the rate at which the bank offers dollars becomes attractive.\par \par \uc2 The bank has been disclosing the amount sold in any of these regular dollar auctions within minutes of the auctions' close. (Reporting by Jason Lange; Editing by Jonathan Oatis)\par \par \uc2 MEXICO-RESERVES/ (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|E|RBN|M|D|U|RNP|DNP  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020090224e52o00165\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
