\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Mexico cbank to continue dollar sales\b0\par\par\uc2 383 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 Februar 2009\par 03:59\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2009 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Adds prices, ratings agency)\par \par \uc2 KUALA LUMPUR, Feb 11 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will continue with its policy of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets to sell dollars, the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor said on Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 The decline in the value of the peso <MXN=> has been a major factor in stubborn inflation pressures in Mexico and data this week showed that while headline inflation had fallen year-on-year, core inflation had risen on an annual basis.\par \par \uc2 "We continue to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the coming weeks because the volatility in world financial markets is unlikely to abate," Guillermo Ortiz told Reuters on the sidelines of a conference in Kuala Lumpur.\par \par \uc2 Ortiz said that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would continue with what he said were "direct" \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  of the past few days.\par \par \uc2 "There were certain players that had taken advantage of this predictability (of the auction system) to build positions," he said.\par \par \uc2 Mexico's peso has lost around a quarter of its value against the dollar since August as the global credit crisis spurred investors to dump emerging market assets and it hit a record low last week.\par \par \uc2 Mexico has sold dollars via regular auctions since October to fight \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  volatility and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Tuesday said it had spent over $1 billion defending the peso last week. [ID:nN10287582].\par \par \uc2 That action has caused Fitch Ratings to say that it was monitoring the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  as part of a broader analysis to decide whether to downgrade its ratings.\par \par \uc2 The peso <MXN=> <MEX01> weakened 1.97 percent at the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's final reference to 14.4825 per dollar on Tuesday, losing ground for the first time in five sessions.\par \par \uc2 Ortiz declined to comment directly on the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rate policy but said that recent inflation data was in line with expectations.\par \par \uc2 "We will see better core numbers," he said.\par \par \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2  said in a report that it expected the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to cut rates by a total of 175 basis points to 6 percent by June. Ortiz declined to comment on whether this was a realistic assumption.\par \par \uc2 (Reporting by David Chance; editing by Tomasz Janowski)\par \par \uc2 FINANCIAL-MEXICO/ORTIZ (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|SI|ABX|BNX|FUN|RNP|DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020090211e52b0004a\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
