\par\par \b \uc2 INTERVIEW- \highlight22\uc2 Mexico FX intervention \highlight\uc2  not necessarily negative-S&P\b0\par\par\uc2 By Walter Brandimarte   \par \uc2 493 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 Februar 2009\par 20:21\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2009 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2  NEW YORK, Feb 10 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2 's new policy of direct \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market is not necessarily negative for its credit-worthiness, as long as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  does not target a specific exchange rate, according to a Standard and Poor's analyst.\par \par \uc2   Lisa Schineller, a director at S&P's sovereign ratings group, said it made sense for the Mexican \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to use its foreign reserves to "smooth" \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swings at times of thin market liquidity, but not to support a naturally weakening peso.\par \par \uc2  "The fact that they are \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  is not a credit negative per se," Schineller told Reuters in an interview late on Monday.\par \par \uc2  "You had an accumulation of international reserves over a number of years to provide a buffer, to be able to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in moments of stress such as this," she said.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  surprised investors last week by directly selling dollars to banks at undisclosed rates -- the first move of that type in more than a decade. Until then, Mexico had been selling dollars only through predictable and transparent auctions.\par \par \uc2  In a separate interview, Fitch analyst Shelly Shetty said the ratings agency is carefully monitoring \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2 's new \b \highlight22\uc2 currency interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  as part of a broader analysis to decide whether to downgrade its ratings. The comments added pressure to the peso earlier in the day.\par \par \uc2  Fitch placed Mexico's sovereign rating on negative outlook in November as it worried about the magnitude of the country's economic contraction and the performance of its fiscal and current accounts.\par \par \uc2  S&P, on the other hand, maintains a stable outlook on the rating, assuming the government will cut expenditures to make up for an expected decline in revenues, just as it has adjusted to adverse conditions in the past.\par \par \uc2  Both agencies rate Mexico at "BBB+," or three notches into investment-grade territory.\par \par \uc2  GOVERNMENT COMMITMENT\par \par \uc2  S&P's Schineller said, however, that \b \highlight22\uc2 currency interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  "cannot reverse the reality of the global environment," in which the Mexican peso is expected to weaken as a result of external shocks.\par \par \uc2  "Clearly the Mexican economy is one of the more strongly hit because of oil, because of the link to the United States," she said.\par \par \uc2  "But it does not necessarily mean pressure on the rating. We're assuming a proactive and prudent policy response, in line with the government long track record of doing so."\par \par \uc2  Government commitment to prudent fiscal and macroeconomic policies, Schineller stressed, is the key for Mexico to keep its ratings amid a global financial crisis.\par \par \uc2  The analyst said S&P would review Mexico's ratings if there was a reversal in the government's prudent policies, or a negative surprise in the private sector forcing the government to take over significant liabilities.   (Editing by Chizu Nomiyama)   \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 MEXICO\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTIONS\b0 \highlight\uc2 /SANDP (INTERVIEW)|LANGEN|ABN|E|RBN|D|M   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020090213e52a002sq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
