\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Mexico \highlight\uc2  markets rise as cenbank confirms  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 By Michael O'Boyle and Lizbeth Salazar   \par \uc2 735 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Februar 2009\par 15:59\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2009 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2  (Recasts; adds \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  statement, details on \uc2 America Movil\uc2  results)\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 MEXICO\b0 \highlight\uc2  CITY, Feb 5 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market for a second straight day on Thursday, boosting the peso \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  after it was hammered to a record low this week amid fears the local economy is heading into recession.\par \par \uc2  The peso <MEX01> <MXN=> firmed 1.44 percent to close at 14.265 per U.S. dollar as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold greenbacks directly to banks, market sources said.\par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and Finance Ministry later confirmed the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in a statement issued after the local market's close.\par \par \uc2  "Basically, it said it will not allow further speculation against the exchange rate," a trader in \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2  City said.\par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  surprised investors by \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Wednesday after fears the U.S. downturn is driving Mexico into recession sent the peso tumbling to its weakest level since new pesos were introduced in 1993.\par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has lost about a quarter of its value against the dollar in the past five months, making it the worst performer among major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  since the global economic crisis deepened late last year.\par \par \uc2  This week's surprise move was \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2 's most direct \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  since 1998, although the bank has been auctioning dollars in recent months to soften the peso's fall.\par \par \uc2  Oil-exporting Mexico has a cushion of around $80 billion in foreign reserves and can tap up to $30 billion from the U.S. Federal Reserve under a global liquidity program.\par \par \uc2  "At this stage, the (Mexican) \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has plenty of ammunition to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 ; admittedly, not to defend an unrealistic level for the peso, but certainly to prevent sharp disorderly adjustments," \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2  economist Alberto Ramos said in a research note.\par \par \uc2  MEXICO EYES RECESSION\par \par \uc2  Mexico's economy, which relies heavily on exports to the United States, is seen shrinking as much as 1.8 percent this year, according to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2  Investors have been worried that a weak \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  will push up the price of imports, fuel higher inflation and keep policy-makers from being able to cut interest rates to boost the slowing economy.\par \par \uc2  In debt trading, bonds gained amid expectations the Banco de \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  will help stabilize the peso.\par \par \uc2  The government's benchmark 10-year peso bond <MX10YT=RR> rose 0.566 of a point in price, pushing its yield down 9 basis points to 7.89 percent.\par \par \uc2  Kathryn Rooney, a strategist at Bulltick Capital Markets in Miami, said the steep downturn threatening Mexico's economy could push credit ratings agencies to downgrade the country's peso-denominated debt.\par \par \uc2  "The bottom line is we are coming to a new equilibrium, a new stabilization of Mexico's peso," Rooney said.\par \par \uc2 Barclays\uc2  analyst Roberto Melzi wrote in a note to clients that given the likely depth of Mexico's recession, he saw the peso fairly valued at around 15 per dollar.\par \par \uc2  To limit steep losses in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  established regular dollar auctions in October, when the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  saw its steepest depreciation in more than a decade.\par \par \uc2  But that program has failed to stabilize the unit.\par \par \uc2  This week's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is different from the auctions because it is arbitrary and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has not disclosed the amount of dollars it has sold.\par \par \uc2  A \uc2 UBS\uc2  bank report said Mexico's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  could have sold as much as $1.5 billion on Wednesday.\par \par \uc2  "If it was that much, it is going to be difficult for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to maintain this level of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said Bulltick's Rooney.\par \par \uc2  The cental bank and Finance Ministry did not disclose the amount of dollars sold to the market on Thursday, but said the figure would be apparent when the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  reports its reserves data next week.\par \par \uc2  In stock trading, the IPC benchmark index <.MXX> rose 0.58 percent to end at 19,736.96 points, led by gains in cellphone operator \uc2 America Movil\uc2   ahead of its fourth-quarter earnings report.\par \par \uc2  After the close, \uc2 America Movil\uc2  posted an unexpected rise in quarterly net profit, helped by hefty subscriber growth despite the economic downturn. For details, see [ID:nN05395478]  (Additional reporting by Cyntia Barrera Diaz and Lorena Segura; editing by Gary Crosse)   \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-MEXICO/ (UPDATE 5)|LANGEN|ABN|E|RBN|U|D|M|RNP|DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020090205e525001ka\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
