\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 3-Mexico  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2  steps in to boost troubled peso\b0\par\par\uc2 By Jason Lange  \par \uc2 484 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Oktober 2008\par 17:30\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2008 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 (Adds new auction Thursday, quotes)\par \par \uc2 MEXICO CITY, Oct 8 (Reuters) - Mexico's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  stepped in on Wednesday to halt the peso's worst slide since the Tequila Crisis of the mid-1990s, stopping the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  from collapsing due to the world financial crisis.\par \par \uc2 Breaking with its long-held aversion to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, the bank offered to auction $2.5 billion and said it was setting up a daily dollar sales mechanism.\par \par \uc2 "The peso has become the whipping boy for emerging markets today," said Gray Newman, senior Latin American economist at \uc2 Morgan Stanley\uc2 , prior to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The credit crunch has thrashed \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  around the world but the peso was particularly hard hit, partly because it is easier to trade than many other emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Newman said. It fell almost 15 percent in a few hours on Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 The fall was compounded by Mexican companies rushing to buy dollars to cover debt payments in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  after supermarket firm Comercial Mexicana <COMEUBC.MX> warned it faced problems paying its debt, becoming the first major Mexican company in serious trouble from the credit crunch.\par \par \uc2 The peso crashed as low as 14.32 to the dollar, its weakest level since the early 1990s.\par \par \uc2 "The exchange movements today were exaggerated and not sustained by fundamentals," Finance Minister Agustin Carstens said.\par \par \uc2 The bank announced it would put $2.5 billion in dollars in the market but managed only to sell $998 million in two auctions. It will hold another auction on Thursday morning.\par \par \uc2 INFLATION\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Gov. Guillermo Ortiz said the peso's fall would not affect Mexico's inflation badly. Lower \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  can often mean higher prices for imports, thus pushing inflation up.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2 's central bankers have often cited a bungled \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  that helped trigger the mid-1990s Tequila Crisis economic meltdown as an example of why authorities should keep their hands out of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets.\par \par \uc2 Mexico took years to recover from the crisis. The country ran out of foreign reserves and the peso plunged, sending millions into bankruptcy and poverty.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  also moved to curb wide fluctuations in the exchange rate by announcing a separate dollar sales program that will kick in when the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  falls by more than 2 percent in one day.\par \par \uc2 Starting Thursday, it will offer to sell $400 million at a minimum 2 percent above the previous day's exchange rate every trading day until further notice.\par \par \uc2 "Consequently, the (daily $400 million) auction will not result in any \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  sales except when the exchange rate has fallen by more than 2 percent," the bank said. (Additional reporting by Noel Randewich, Michael O'Boyle, Robert Campbell and Alistair Bell; Editing by Diane Craft)\par \par \uc2 MEXICO-PESO/CENTRALBANK (UPDATE 3)|LANGEN|ABN|D|M|E|RBN|U|RNP|DNP  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020081008e4a8001fi\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
